Z||000008||WKDFIRO||12-09-1999||09:24 PM||||When I was building my engine we had some parts going to the powdercoating shop. I hurriedly got the sander and sanded all of the casting flash off and asked them to polish the top, (I had a 85 V6) and also the collar that the thorttle body bolts on to. I had the throttle body polished too and when it all goes together it looks great! Its is a small detail but it almost makes the throttle body look like an intregal part of the intake plenum. Wish I had pics to post but it came out great! Its the little things that add up!||||reg||6
